<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Northern Irish premier</p>
<p>division soccer matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Coleraine	     3   Glentoran	    2</p>
<p> Crusaders	     3   Ards		   1</p>
<p> Linfield		3   Glenavon	     0</p>
<p> Portadown	     0   Cliftonville	 0</p>
<p>(match abandoned at halftime due to crowd trouble)</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, agains, points):</p>
<p> Coleraine		 3  3  0  0   5   2   9</p>
<p> Crusaders		 3  2  1  0   6   3   7</p>
<p> Linfield		  3  1  1  1   3   1   4</p>
<p> Portadown		 3  1  1  1   3   3   4</p>
<p> Cliftonville	    3  1  1  1   2   2   4</p>
<p> Glenavon		  3  1  1  1   4   6   4</p>
<p> Glentoran		 3  0  1  2   4   6   1</p>
<p> Ards			3  0  0  3   3   7   0</p>
</text>
